#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:47
msgid "Rotating the Transformation Bounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:49
msgid ""
"It is possible to rotate the visual transformation bounds without "
"transforming the image itself. This is particularly useful when dealing with "
"sections of an image that were drawn diagonally, like for example, a stick "
"at an angle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:51
msgid ""
"When using Krita's default key bindings, pressing :kbd:`Ctrl + Alt` before "
"trying to rotate, the cursor will switch to a bounds-rotation cursor, at "
"which point a |mouseleft| + drag will rotate the visual bounds. Then, "
"releasing the keys, a regular transformation can be performed. By rotating "
"the transformation bounds to the actual image being transformed, it can be "
"easier to transform the image afterwards, especially when aligning at a "
"certain angle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:53
msgid ""
"The actual keys  used for this can be configured under :menuselection:"
"`Settings --> Configure Krita... --> Canvas input settings --> Alternate "
"invocation` and assigning any of the actions that sample a color from the "
"current layer. Depending on which presets you use, this may not be bound to "
"anything by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:58
msgid "Perspective"
msgstr "Perspektywa"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:60
msgid ""
"While free transform has some perspective options, the perspective transform "
"allows for maximum control. You can drag the corner points, or even the "
"designated vanishing point."
msgstr ""
"Podczas gdy odręczne przekształcenie zawiera ustawienia perspektywy, to "
"przekształcenie perspektywy daje ci największe możliwości. Możesz przeciągać "
"punkty narożne lub nawet wybrane punkty zanikające."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/transform.rst:62
msgid ""
"You can also change the size, shear and position transform while remaining "
"in perspective with the tool-options."
msgstr ""
"Możesz zmienić rozmiar, pochylić oraz umieścić przekształcenie nadal "
"pozostając w perspektywie przy użyciu ustawień narzędzia."

